Results.ReviewText:
Traeger continues to raise the bar with every release. The Pro 575 combines the original Traeger features that everyone loves with WiFire technology that takes hands-off to a whole new level. In addition the D2 Direct Drive is bullet proof. With the ability to monitor your cook from anywhere combined with recipes on the Traeger app that dummy proof cooking there is NO reason we all can’t be grilling several nights a week!!! 

CJ Russell 
@smokin_trinity_bbq
